WEBVTT

00:01.110 --> 00:03.440
Good news and bad news, you say?

00:03.440 --> 00:06.400
I'd like to make my report 
to you first, Prince Sion.

00:06.880 --> 00:07.950
Is that all right?

00:12.260 --> 00:15.280
Prince Abel, are you all right?

00:15.540 --> 00:18.990
Yes. Your retainer helped me out.

00:19.230 --> 00:24.210
<i>It feels like you've developed 
more fortitude again, Prince Abel.</i>

00:24.480 --> 00:27.780
Princess Mia, your face seems flushed. 
Are you all right?

00:27.780 --> 00:31.120
Huh? It's n-nothing. I'm fine.

00:31.120 --> 00:33.420
You didn't push yourself 
too hard to get here?

00:33.420 --> 00:36.560
I'm pretty sure <i>you're</i> the one 
who's been pushing yourself...

00:36.560 --> 00:38.550
I don't want to hear it!

00:39.570 --> 00:44.080
You ignored me earlier and put 
yourself in danger, Prince Abel.

00:44.080 --> 00:47.630
And Sion was attacking you in earnest.

00:47.630 --> 00:49.400
Unbelievable!

00:51.760 --> 00:54.030
You don't use Prince Sion's title anymore.

00:54.380 --> 00:57.640
Huh? We were doing it 
to hide our identities.

00:57.640 --> 00:59.780
There's no meaning behind it.

01:00.260 --> 01:02.160
Oh, I see.

01:02.160 --> 01:03.540
Good.

01:03.910 --> 01:06.720
<i>Was he jealous?</i>

01:06.720 --> 01:09.450
<i>Goodness. What will we do with you?</i>

01:09.450 --> 01:14.980
<i>As the more mature one, I'll just 
have to coolly and maturely propose</i>

01:14.980 --> 01:17.640
<i>that we address each other without titles.</i>

01:18.190 --> 01:19.000
Listen...

01:19.910 --> 01:21.400
Uh, I, um...

01:23.850 --> 01:27.330
You see, I w-wouldn't really mind,

01:27.330 --> 01:30.470
if you were to call me... um...

01:31.330 --> 01:34.570
Mia, without my title...

01:35.030 --> 01:41.530
A-A-And then I'd, um... call you 
A-A-Abel, without your title.

01:41.950 --> 01:43.310
Really?

01:43.990 --> 01:47.500
Um... uh... in that case...

01:47.920 --> 01:50.030
M-Mia...

01:50.030 --> 01:54.210
Y-Yes. A-A-Abel?

01:54.840 --> 01:56.480
Y-Yes.

01:56.480 --> 01:58.550
Prince Abel. Mia.

01:59.470 --> 02:00.660
We need to talk.

02:02.610 --> 02:04.930
I'm afraid I must apologize to you.

02:04.930 --> 02:06.350
What do you mean?

02:06.690 --> 02:10.250
This uprising appears to have been instigated

02:10.250 --> 02:14.620
by a rogue unit within our kingdom's 
intelligence agency, the Wind Crows.

02:14.620 --> 02:16.030
Wh-Wha...

02:16.490 --> 02:17.850
What did you say?!

03:49.500 --> 03:55.580
<b>Episode 12: To Keep What Was Preciously Grown from Withering</b>

03:50.040 --> 03:52.420
<i>But that would certainly make sense.</i>

03:52.420 --> 03:55.840
<i>After both the Empire and Remno's rebellions,</i>

03:55.840 --> 03:58.960
<i>it's Sunkland that comes out looking good.</i>

04:00.260 --> 04:05.050
<i>Wait, so then all the events that led 
to me being put to the guillotine</i>

04:05.050 --> 04:09.020
<i>were actually brought about by 
the people who condemned me?</i>

04:13.010 --> 04:17.310
<i>This is like he's hanging his head to me.</i>

04:18.340 --> 04:22.280
<i>I can't say it feels all that good to see it.</i>

04:23.460 --> 04:26.490
<i>I wonder what Prince Abel intends to do.</i>

04:26.990 --> 04:31.910
<i>Strictly speaking, it wasn't Sion 
himself who set the trap for Remno.</i>

04:31.910 --> 04:34.960
<i>It's the Kingdom of Sunkland that 
ought to shoulder responsibility.</i>

04:35.220 --> 04:39.030
<i>But I doubt Sion would find that acceptable.</i>

04:39.030 --> 04:44.170
<i>Plus, Prince Abel has the 
right to condemn Sion.</i>

04:45.130 --> 04:47.910
Raise your head, Prince Sion.

04:48.510 --> 04:49.870
But...

04:49.870 --> 04:53.140
Royals must take royal responsibility.

04:54.910 --> 04:58.780
Our responsibility is to rule 
with concern for our subjects.

04:58.780 --> 05:04.070
Because of that, I believed I had to use 
the military to control the situation.

05:04.070 --> 05:08.540
But we have someone who has shown 
us a way to stop this conflict.

05:09.830 --> 05:12.830
This truly ridiculous conflict.

05:13.690 --> 05:17.290
We have someone who has illuminated 
the path we should take.

05:18.140 --> 05:22.140
Thus, what we must do 
is march down that path.

05:22.830 --> 05:24.210
Isn't that so?

05:31.630 --> 05:36.600
Even if I hang my head and beg forgiveness, 
that only makes me feel better.

05:36.600 --> 05:37.950
I see your point.

05:37.950 --> 05:40.520
We were both saved, you and I.

05:40.950 --> 05:45.490
Now we have but to proceed down the path 
the Wisdom of the Empire has illuminated.

05:45.750 --> 05:48.750
It seems you've forgiven him. I'm glad.

05:48.750 --> 05:52.950
To be honest, I can't say my 
father is free of guilt.

05:52.950 --> 05:55.500
So I can't blame this entirely on Sunkland.

05:56.070 --> 05:57.960
Mia, this is thanks to you.

05:58.550 --> 06:01.170
<i>Oh, I'm so glad.</i>

06:01.170 --> 06:02.990
<i>Still...</i>

06:02.990 --> 06:07.050
Sion, you've finally experienced failure.

06:08.060 --> 06:10.970
People make mistakes.

06:11.340 --> 06:14.220
No person can live perfectly.

06:14.220 --> 06:18.690
That's precisely why you must at least 
give people a chance to start over.

06:19.420 --> 06:21.360
<i>Especially me!</i>

06:21.360 --> 06:22.880
<i>Mia added this silently but firmly,</i>

06:22.880 --> 06:28.900
<i>having never been given such a 
chance in the previous timeline.</i>

06:29.410 --> 06:32.630
<i>But if what happened here in Remno</i>

06:32.630 --> 06:35.580
<i>was also what was going on 
during the Empire's revolution,</i>

06:35.580 --> 06:40.750
<i>then I can't say this self-proclaimed 
"champion of justice" was fully blameless.</i>

06:41.350 --> 06:45.260
<i>Looking at it that way, I'm a little pissed.</i>

06:45.260 --> 06:48.790
<i>This is my chance to get back 
at him just a little bit...</i>

06:49.630 --> 06:55.350
Sion, so you never forget your blunder, 
I'm going to etch it into you.

06:56.260 --> 06:57.310
What do you mean?

06:58.110 --> 07:02.770
Sin is absolved only once 
a punishment is granted.

07:03.150 --> 07:05.710
Punishment, you say? Y-Your Highness...

07:05.710 --> 07:07.620
No, she's quite right.

07:08.410 --> 07:10.130
I shall accept punishment.

07:10.670 --> 07:12.110
What should I do?

07:12.400 --> 07:14.540
A fine mindset.

07:14.540 --> 07:16.830
Now then, stand there.

07:24.830 --> 07:29.210
<i>I have a move I've wisely 
continued to train and refine.</i>

07:29.580 --> 07:34.930
You know something, Your Highness? 
Your kicks don't hurt at all.

07:34.930 --> 07:38.660
<i>Since that day, I've continuously 
heightened the power of my kick!</i>

07:38.660 --> 07:41.640
<i>I'm going to make you feel 
this pain as hard as I can!</i>

07:52.650 --> 07:57.780
<i>Etch this lesson into your mind 
along with the pain, Sion!</i>

08:00.040 --> 08:01.400
<i>It didn't hurt...</i>

08:01.920 --> 08:03.500
<i>What's going on?</i>

08:04.230 --> 08:05.870
<i>Did she do it that way on purpose?</i>

08:07.010 --> 08:11.780
<i>Outwardly, I have been given 
a punishment for my actions.</i>

08:11.780 --> 08:17.260
<i>But I myself am aware that in reality, 
no punishment has been given.</i>

08:17.740 --> 08:21.840
<i>Thus my sin, my suffering, 
will never be erased.</i>

08:22.350 --> 08:25.090
<i>From now on, whenever 
I attempt to carry out justice,</i>

08:25.090 --> 08:29.230
<i>I'll ask myself whether what 
I'm doing is truly just.</i>

08:29.950 --> 08:37.160
<i>And I'll question whether the other 
person could be forgiven, just as I was.</i>

08:38.780 --> 08:42.150
Condemn fairly. Carry out justice.

08:42.150 --> 08:44.370
These words have been drilled 
into me since childhood.

08:44.370 --> 08:49.000
Those words' true meaning, its weight,
 and the difficulty of it....

08:49.530 --> 08:51.130
I've now understood for the first time.

08:51.520 --> 08:53.720
Uh, erm, Sion...

08:54.020 --> 08:55.800
Mia, thank you.

08:56.230 --> 08:58.760
You are indeed the Wisdom of the Empire.

08:59.100 --> 09:03.730
<i>H-He's thanking me for kicking him?
 What's going on?</i>

09:04.220 --> 09:08.310
If you'd never said anything to me, 
I probably never would have realized.

09:08.560 --> 09:12.970
<i>R-Realized? Realized what? 
What did he realize?</i>

09:12.970 --> 09:15.080
<i>And this Wisdom of the Empire stuff...</i>

09:15.080 --> 09:17.410
<i>What does wisdom 
have to do with kicking?</i>

09:17.410 --> 09:20.690
<i>Is it that the force and the 
angle are important or something?</i>

09:20.690 --> 09:26.290
<i>What do I do if he says I'm so good at it 
he wants me to kick him again some time?!</i>

09:26.750 --> 09:30.120
O-Oh. I'm glad to hear that.

09:30.120 --> 09:35.010
B-By the way, have we learned where 
Chancellor Dasayev is being held?

09:35.250 --> 09:40.220
According to the report, he's being 
confined in the town of Xenia.

09:41.470 --> 09:44.930
Prince Abel, does this location 
look familiar to you?

09:45.210 --> 09:49.810
No, but perhaps one of the 
soldiers knows where this is.

09:49.810 --> 09:53.690
In that case, perhaps we 
should ask Lynsha about it.

09:53.690 --> 09:54.940
Lynsha?

09:54.940 --> 09:58.910
Well, I became acquainted with the 
younger sister of rebels' leader.

09:59.200 --> 10:02.560
I see. You've already gotten that far.

10:02.560 --> 10:08.080
Forgive me, but would it be all right 
if I took your retainer along?

10:08.410 --> 10:13.550
I'd prefer not to let Bernard know yet 
that Sunkland was involved in any of this.

10:13.550 --> 10:16.920
Well, I don't think he'd mind...

10:17.540 --> 10:22.980
<i>This means I'm going along too, doesn't it?</i>

10:22.980 --> 10:25.890
<i>Yes, yes. I knew it.</i>

10:30.600 --> 10:31.650
We're here.

10:32.010 --> 10:33.900
This is the building on the map.

10:37.810 --> 10:43.950
<i>The man who arranged the circumstances for 
that pain is right here in this building.</i>

10:47.450 --> 10:48.870
<i>It'll be all right.</i>

10:49.490 --> 10:51.700
<i>This is definitely going to go well.</i>

10:57.120 --> 10:58.640
Damn it!

10:58.640 --> 11:02.970
This was supposed to be the point where 
chaos had been stirred up in the Empire!

11:02.970 --> 11:07.810
This is all the Wisdom of the 
Empire's fault! Mia Luna Tearmoon!

11:08.300 --> 11:12.650
The Empire's collapse was to start a chain 
reaction of collapse for all nations.

11:12.650 --> 11:15.320
The chaos resulting from 
the destruction of order...

11:15.320 --> 11:17.550
<i>That</i> is our fierce wish!

11:17.550 --> 11:20.750
I won't let some little girl 
stand in the way any longer!

11:21.600 --> 11:23.580
All those within the building!

11:23.580 --> 11:25.120
Cast aside your weapons and come out!

11:25.590 --> 11:28.160
I am Sion Sol Sunkland!

11:28.160 --> 11:31.060
The scheme of the Albi 
has already been exposed.

11:31.060 --> 11:33.210
There is no point in resisting!

11:33.760 --> 11:37.500
<i>I didn't expect him to shout loudly 
before we stormed the place.</i>

11:37.500 --> 11:39.860
<i>Is this really a good idea?</i>

11:39.860 --> 11:43.220
<i>This vague bad feeling I have 
is just my imagination, right?</i>

11:43.680 --> 11:47.760
<i>A rare instance where Mia's 
bad feeling was inaccurate.</i>

11:47.760 --> 11:48.640
Let's go!

11:49.720 --> 11:52.850
<i>Having made an enemy of their own prince,</i>

11:52.850 --> 11:58.020
<i>and faced with fearsome opponents 
they could not hope to best,</i>

11:58.020 --> 12:04.450
<i>the men lost the will to fight one after another, 
surrendered, and exited the manor.</i>

12:04.710 --> 12:07.900
It looks like everything's going to work out.

12:07.900 --> 12:11.350
Princess Mia, your hair looks a little rough.

12:11.350 --> 12:13.830
The thing is, the shampoo 
here is a little lacking.

12:13.830 --> 12:17.710
I feel like the one from 
Abel was more slippery.

12:18.210 --> 12:20.550
Worry not, Princess Mia.

12:21.110 --> 12:23.760
Look, I brought it with me.

12:24.090 --> 12:27.470
Oh, my! That's fantastic, Anne!

12:27.870 --> 12:33.230
I was intending to take a nice 
long bath after this fight ended.

12:33.230 --> 12:35.940
Now I'm looking forward to it even more!

12:36.900 --> 12:40.130
<i>A line one should not say on the battlefield.</i>

12:40.130 --> 12:43.800
<i>Yet Mia declared it loudly 
and with merriment.</i>

12:43.800 --> 12:48.370
<i>And just when things were going so well...</i>

13:04.910 --> 13:06.660
Ow, ow, ow...

13:07.900 --> 13:11.380
What a surprise, Your Highness Princess Mia.

13:11.380 --> 13:13.430
What an honor to meet you.

13:21.000 --> 13:22.380
Mia, are you okay?

13:23.340 --> 13:24.990
So you're Jem?

13:24.990 --> 13:29.410
I see. So that speech earlier was true.

13:29.410 --> 13:32.620
Indeed. Your comrades have surrendered.

13:32.620 --> 13:34.430
It's futile to resist.

13:35.840 --> 13:38.990
We've already rescued
 Count Dasayev Donovan, too.

13:38.990 --> 13:40.540
All that's left is you.

13:45.070 --> 13:48.220
So you've even found the 
secret path to the dungeon.

13:48.220 --> 13:53.180
So not just Prince Sion but his retainer 
as well lives up to the rumors.

13:55.830 --> 13:58.560
Not so fast. You stay right there.

13:58.970 --> 13:59.810
Mia!

14:00.100 --> 14:02.370
Don't get any funny ideas.

14:02.370 --> 14:06.030
It would be simple for 
me to lop your head off.

14:06.030 --> 14:07.850
Cease this foolishness!

14:07.850 --> 14:11.680
Sunkland won't protect the 
Wind Crows or the Albi.

14:11.680 --> 14:14.410
You plan has already failed.

14:15.040 --> 14:19.420
Don't say such harsh things, Your Highness.

14:19.870 --> 14:23.880
The shock may cause my hand to slip.

14:25.430 --> 14:30.670
After having my long and 
hard-fought plan ruined by this girl,

14:30.670 --> 14:33.390
I'm bitter to the core.

14:41.020 --> 14:43.620
You may be the Wisdom of the Empire, 
but a brat is still a brat.

14:43.620 --> 14:45.610
How pathetic!

14:45.940 --> 14:50.950
<i>Seeing Mia's skirt wet, 
everyone present thought:</i>

14:50.950 --> 14:55.910
<i>"Ah, Mia is so scared she wet herself."</i>

14:56.450 --> 15:01.370
<i>However, there was one person, 
one person alone who realized the truth.</i>

15:02.060 --> 15:05.090
<i>No, this is the smell of...</i>

15:07.510 --> 15:09.220
Princess Mia, run!

15:13.240 --> 15:15.020
You brat!

15:36.010 --> 15:40.410
I didn't imagine the princess 
would deliver the final blow.

15:40.850 --> 15:46.030
<i>Thus was Jem, one of the masterminds, 
brilliantly defeated.</i>

15:46.030 --> 15:51.690
<i>The winning move that drew things to a 
close was a brilliant kick unleashed from</i>

15:51.690 --> 15:55.890
<i>the beautiful legs of Mia Luna Tearmoon, 
Wisdom of the Empire.</i>

16:03.020 --> 16:05.690
Prince Abel, Prince Sion,

16:05.690 --> 16:07.770
I have a request for the two of you.

16:08.310 --> 16:12.950
Could you somehow spare 
these people their lives?

16:13.460 --> 16:18.200
<i>A request for clemency that, normally, 
could of course not be heeded.</i>

16:18.550 --> 16:21.770
<i>However, the two princes 
simultaneously thought:</i>

16:22.700 --> 16:23.830
<i>I knew it.</i>

16:23.830 --> 16:26.170
<i>So that </i>is<i> what Mia wants.</i>

16:26.440 --> 16:28.540
<i>For the intelligence agents,</i>

16:28.540 --> 16:33.130
<i>the most lenient compromise I could get 
for them is probably banishment.</i>

16:33.690 --> 16:38.600
<i>The tricky part would likely be the 
subjects of Remno who rebelled.</i>

16:38.960 --> 16:43.310
<i>Lynsha and her brother Lambert 
would normally be executed.</i>

16:43.990 --> 16:46.750
<i>Mia put in the utmost effort.</i>

16:46.750 --> 16:52.520
<i>Given that, I probably ought to use all the 
authority I possess to grant what she asks.</i>

16:53.320 --> 16:55.280
<i>But it's a difficult position.</i>

16:55.920 --> 17:00.240
<i>Assuming for the moment Remno gives 
the light sentence of banishment,</i>

17:00.850 --> 17:03.500
<i>that would make it hard for 
Sunkland to seek execution.</i>

17:03.500 --> 17:05.820
<i>People would think we did it to silence them.</i>

17:06.490 --> 17:10.960
<i>I could have Prince Abel 
push for that on his side.</i>

17:11.350 --> 17:13.920
<i>Then the problem becomes what 
to do with these people.</i>

17:13.920 --> 17:16.690
<i>I wonder what Mia has in mind.</i>

17:16.690 --> 17:19.390
You aren't going to execute us? 
Are you serious?

17:19.640 --> 17:22.440
What, are you planning to torture us?

17:22.440 --> 17:25.350
Sorry to disappoint you, but you 
won't be getting anything out of me!

17:25.350 --> 17:30.820
<i>Torture... So the princess believes 
there's still more going on here, eh?</i>

17:31.280 --> 17:36.430
<i>Still, he doesn't seem likely 
to crack easily, just as he claims.</i>

17:36.430 --> 17:38.780
<i>I wonder what the princess has in mind.</i>

17:38.780 --> 17:41.100
<i>Although this goes without saying,</i>

17:41.100 --> 17:45.500
<i>Mia was not showing them any 
particular mercy or benevolence.</i>

17:46.130 --> 17:51.320
<i>I was given an opportunity to redo 
everything. What if they get one?</i>

17:51.320 --> 17:53.710
<i>Could that be possible?</i>

17:53.970 --> 17:56.470
<i>If so, what would the trigger conditions be?</i>

17:57.200 --> 17:58.990
<i>I can't say for sure...</i>

17:58.990 --> 18:06.160
<i>Possibly, it's being killed on that same day, 
at the same time, at the same place...</i>

18:06.160 --> 18:11.690
<i>Or maybe being beheaded by a guillotine, 
or maybe dying with regrets...</i>

18:06.980 --> 18:11.690
Ahuh, ahuh, ahuh...

18:12.390 --> 18:15.220
<i>If these conspirators are executed...</i>

18:15.220 --> 18:17.150
<i>That's another potential condition.</i>

18:17.450 --> 18:22.250
<i>Whatever the case, if these men 
get killed in the same way I was</i>

18:22.250 --> 18:24.620
<i>and gain an opportunity to redo things,</i>

18:24.620 --> 18:27.900
<i>then all the effort I've poured into 
successfully changing history...</i>

18:27.900 --> 18:31.020
<i>it could all be overturned and reversed!</i>

18:31.020 --> 18:32.340
What?!

18:32.930 --> 18:37.050
<i>I absolutely refuse to be 
sent back to the guillotine!</i>

18:38.570 --> 18:42.680
<i>That was a thought that has repeatedly 
seized Mia since she reincarnated.</i>

18:43.320 --> 18:48.890
<i>However, Mia realized there was something 
she felt even stronger than that.</i>

18:49.150 --> 18:51.400
<i>And that's not all.</i>

18:51.400 --> 18:55.530
<i>I rather fancy this time, the present one.</i>

18:56.160 --> 18:57.490
<i>I mean...</i>

18:57.490 --> 18:59.450
<i>my former enemy Sion...</i>

19:00.280 --> 19:02.640
<i>his retainer Keithwood...</i>

19:03.690 --> 19:05.120
<i>Lady Tiona...</i>

19:06.080 --> 19:08.600
<i>Mr. Dion who beheaded me...</i>

19:10.080 --> 19:12.500
<i>Abel, who was essentially a stranger to me...</i>

19:13.540 --> 19:16.050
<i>Those who helped me get here... Chloe...</i>

19:17.290 --> 19:18.460
<i>Princess Rafina...</i>

19:19.920 --> 19:22.770
<i>And of course Anne and Ludwig...</i>

19:25.590 --> 19:28.270
<i>Until recently, I was all alone.</i>

19:28.270 --> 19:32.820
<i>But now, in this time, 
my world is so very warm.</i>

19:33.390 --> 19:37.110
<i>If I can, I'd like to have 
them at my side forever.</i>

19:37.460 --> 19:41.570
<i>D-Don't you dare misunderstand 
me, Sion! Lady Tiona!</i>

19:41.870 --> 19:46.110
<i>This doesn't mean I like you. Got that?</i>

19:47.230 --> 19:52.560
Abel, I know that would cause 
problems for you, but...

19:52.560 --> 19:54.290
Say no more.

19:54.290 --> 19:56.990
I'll find a way to persuade my father.

19:57.850 --> 20:02.300
Still, assuming we save them from execution, 
what do you intend to do with them?

20:02.550 --> 20:06.510
Oh, come on. You're seriously 
going to let us live?

20:06.510 --> 20:08.970
What a softie.

20:09.210 --> 20:13.010
<i>This guy kinda pisses me off.</i>

20:13.010 --> 20:17.320
I've got it! Let's put Princess 
Rafina in charge of them

20:17.320 --> 20:22.280
and have her lecture them every day
 for three years! How about that?

20:22.280 --> 20:24.990
I do hope you've prepared yourselves.

20:25.580 --> 20:26.890
That sounds good to me.

20:28.380 --> 20:30.040
That's cute...

20:30.040 --> 20:31.750
Y-You've got to be kidding!

20:31.750 --> 20:33.710
This isn't a game!

20:34.200 --> 20:39.170
Oh? What happened to your
 "Bring on the torture" attitude?

20:39.970 --> 20:46.270
<i>Little did anyone know that Mia's 
decision here would be the first blow</i>

20:46.270 --> 20:49.170
<i>in exposing a darkness lurking 
in the shadows of history.</i>

20:49.170 --> 20:51.710
<i>But that's another story.</i>

20:51.710 --> 20:55.770
<i>Thus were the disturbances in 
the Kingdom of Remno resolved.</i>

20:56.410 --> 21:02.630
<i>Out of esteem for Mia's wishes,
 Tiona and Ludwig ventured to the capital</i>

21:02.630 --> 21:05.890
<i>and interceded so that Lambert, 
Lynsha, and the main rebels</i>

21:05.890 --> 21:09.530
<i>would be treated with warmth 
rather than wariness.</i>

21:09.530 --> 21:11.620
<i>Having safely quelled the turmoil,</i>

21:11.620 --> 21:15.580
<i>Mia and the others made their 
return trip to the academy.</i>

21:16.860 --> 21:19.590
My! My, oh, my!

21:19.590 --> 21:22.340
What a lovely sight!

21:22.720 --> 21:24.540
Ms. Anne, you prepared all this?

21:24.540 --> 21:30.760
Yes. I did my utmost to prepare
 these for our picnic today!

21:30.760 --> 21:33.040
Of course.

21:33.040 --> 21:35.310
I made... this!

21:35.310 --> 21:38.270
I feel like I've seen this before...

21:38.270 --> 21:42.030
This time it was cooked in 
an oven rather than outside.

21:42.360 --> 21:44.490
And I salted it, just right!

21:44.790 --> 21:47.210
You really get it, Ms. Liora.

21:47.210 --> 21:50.740
Sweet and salty form an 
endless cycle of happiness.

21:51.090 --> 21:54.000
I brought a variety of teas.

21:57.000 --> 21:59.130
What a lovely fragrance.

21:59.130 --> 21:59.780
That reminds me.

21:59.780 --> 22:04.540
Princess Rafina, I am sorry for all the trouble 
we brought your way the other day.

22:04.540 --> 22:07.010
Oh, you mean them?

22:07.010 --> 22:11.220
Just as Princess Mia proposed, 
I'm lecturing them every day.

22:15.500 --> 22:18.190
Oh, my! This is incredibly delicious!

22:18.730 --> 22:20.020
Abel, you should try it!

22:22.060 --> 22:23.480
You got some on your face.

22:30.810 --> 22:32.160
Is something the matter?

22:34.170 --> 22:37.980
I was just thinking what a happy thing it is

22:37.980 --> 22:39.830
that we get to have a 
picnic together like this.

22:41.010 --> 22:42.170
You're right.

22:54.400 --> 22:57.100
<i>The future is not yet set in stone.</i>

22:57.100 --> 23:01.560
<i>Who can say just how 
Mia's life will turn out?</i>

23:02.040 --> 23:06.030
<i>Still, I want to experience 
even more happiness!</i>

23:06.030 --> 23:11.830
<i>The one thing that remains certain 
is that Mia will never compromise.</i>

23:12.380 --> 23:13.950
<i>Not on her happiness,</i>

23:13.950 --> 23:17.870
<i>nor on the happiness of those dear to her.</i>

23:19.060 --> 23:23.940
<i>This is the story of a slightly 
selfish princess's second chance.</i>

23:24.560 --> 23:29.660
<i>How will the seeds of hope 
she's planted color the future?</i>

23:29.660 --> 23:32.720
<i>No one yet knows.</i>

23:34.930 --> 23:39.930
Illustration by:
